{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
knotify watches through kqueue(2), which needs an open file descriptor
for every file and directory it watches: with --recursive, one per
entry in the tree. Keep the per-process limit (kern.maxfilesperproc,
and the openfiles limit of the login class the watcher runs under)
above the number of entries in the largest tree it watches.
EOM
}
